\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>3-4-77\n\nThe Chief Justice +\nDo n agree wi all v Ct&#x27;s hldgs in\nthis area. To extent ty apply, ty\ncontrol. But do ty apply?\n\nBrennan, J. +\n\nStewart, J. +\nNy cd hv a much better stat\nCd req assertion v 5 Am priv &amp; then gi\n[inserted: use immunity]\nVery sloppy stat\n\nWhite, J. +\nI wd per curiam it</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1976 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Harry A. Blackmun</p><h2>Milliken, Governor of Michigan, et al. v. Bradley et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/76015dea-a724-4fa1-a2b6-522a689fadb3.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>3-27-77\n\nThe Chief Justice pass\nIn granting collat relief, D Ct went\nbeyond what was requested\nScope of t rem is within t [underlined: power] of t\nD Ct\nReal prob is 11 Am\nState&#x27;s viol of has never b disturbed\nremain pass\n\nBrennan, J. +\nSch Bd&#x27;s plan was approved\nScope of t rem OK\nState was D. ∴ no 11 Am prob\nno order to pay money, just\nshare t costs\n\nStewart, J. pass\nHard for me\nNo 11 Am prob\nScope of rem troublesome\nA raid on t St treas. Sch Bd\ncd n get t funds any other way\nremain pass\n\nWhite, J. +\nScope of rem OK\nNo subst 11 Am prob</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1976 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Cook et al. v. Hudson et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button dat