></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1976 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Environmental Protection Agency v. Brown, Governor of California, et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/66a11386-9198-4997-8501-b4acaf0c4d59.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/1941\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>[underlined: Stevens] - Agree generally\nwith Byron\nSome of case is clearly\nhere. Would decide\non merits\n\nResult of this discussion\nis to Vacate + Remand.\nby a P. C.</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1976 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Lefkowitz, Attorney General of New York v. Cunningham et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/4556732d-7303-402b-bae8-94c8e60b9da3.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/1941\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>[underlined: Marshall] - affirm\n\n[underlined: Blackmun] - affirm\n\n[underlined: Powell] - affirm - P.C. OK\nPrior cases control.\n\n[underlined: Stevens] - Reverse</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1976 term &nb